description=NX789J (RedMagic 10 Pro / 10S Pro; also accepts NX809J model, Android 15/16) independent recovery and saved-feature resume after first unlock. Action revokes enabled authority. Optional verified boot-animation file bind with incomplete-boot rollback. No full boot-loop recovery promise.
